{"id":"571230a8af3bcd56","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-sigma-one-formula.md","title":"Sigma-One Arithmetical Formulas","display":"df-sigma-one-formula — Sigma-One Arithmetical Formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-sigma-one-formula","aliases":["89-df-sigma-one-formula"],"display":"df-sigma-one-formula — Sigma-One Arithmetical Formulas","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-sigma-one-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-sigma-one-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-one-formula — Sigma-One Arithmetical Formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是算术签名生成的有限项集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;t\">\\(x&lt;t\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists z(x+Sz=t)\">\\(\\exists z(x+Sz=t)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 按指标选新变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,A\">\\(\\forall x&lt;t\\,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A)\">\\(\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\bar x(B\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(\\forall\\bar x(B\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 的全部自由变元按指标递增闭合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{str}}_1\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{str}}_1\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\)</span> 是下面构造的公式类；前者按书中严格 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 生成，后者按 PA 可证等价扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}one\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u=v, 0=u, Su=v, u+v=w, u\\times v=w\n\\mid u,v,w\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq E_n\n\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B\\mid A,B\\in E_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\mid A\\in E_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\cup\\{\\forall x&lt;y\\,A\\mid A\\in E_n,\nx,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}, x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{str}}_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}E_n,\\\\\n\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\exists A\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{str}}_1\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall\\bar x(B\\leftrightarrow A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}one\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u=v, 0=u, Su=v, u+v=w, u\\times v=w\n\\mid u,v,w\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq E_n\n\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B\\mid A,B\\in E_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\mid A\\in E_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\cup\\{\\forall x&lt;y\\,A\\mid A\\in E_n,\nx,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}, x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{str}}_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}E_n,\\\\\n\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\exists A\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{str}}_1\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall\\bar x(B\\leftrightarrow A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 25–26；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n严格基底忠实取原书的五种变量原子形式，未把任意项等式或其否定直接加入严格基底。任意项等式可通过引入存在变量拆成五种形式；否定等式经不等式的两个方向展开，均在 PA 可证等价意义下属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\)</span>。因此严格语法与等价扩展的角色不同。本条给出原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>）公式的实际生成接口；自由否定与无界全称量词不在生成规则中。有限阶段及确定的新变量选择保证集合和展开句法存在。这里说“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 公式”取可证等价版本；书中后续 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_3\">\\(\\Sigma_3\\)</span> 分类用更高交替层次，不能与本类混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithme